SUMMARY:Comedy at The Funk: Brittany Carney
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Comedy Fans\nModelface Comedy Club brings you the be
 st comedians from all over the country! This week we have Brittany Carny f
 rom NYC!\n\nBrittany Carney performs around the country\, and is based in 
 New York. She is listed as one of Vulture Magazine's "Comedians You Should
  and Will Know." She wrote for and acted in That Damn Michael Che\, and ap
 pears on Fantasmas\, on HBO Max. Brittany has also written for Adult Swim 
 and and Audible. She has opened Stavros Halkias\, Gary Gulman\, Joe Pera\,
  and Moshe Kasher. Brittany's debut special\, That Is My Horse\," is avail
 able on Youtube and Prime TV.\n\nages 18+\nDoors at 6:30pm\, show at 7pm\n
 Full dinner menu available\nTickets $18
